<title>HUNGARY: Hungary six-month BUBOR rate rises to 21.01 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary six-month BUBOR rate rises to 21.01 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) was steady for the one- and three-month maturities on Friday, while six-month rate rose one basis point, the National Bank of Hungary said on its  BUBOR Reuters page.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 20.79 percent, the three-month rate at 20.90 percent, while the six-month rate was set at 21.01 percent.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
